Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:48.33,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:53.68,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:55.07,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General-!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:03:58.69,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Excellency! You were going to betroth Diaochan to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:00.92,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Why did you send her to the Grand Preceptor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:03.87,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General, please calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:06.96,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General, you misunderstand this old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.37,0:04:07.93,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,After you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.29,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Someone told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.31,0:04:25.44,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,You sent her in a carriage to his mansion as a gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:29.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(340.667,478.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2345,2680)}Wáng Yǔn\NStyled: Zǐshī
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.76,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,The General may not know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:34.83,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,yesterday in court, the Grand Preceptor told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:37.70,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,"I have something to discuss."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:40.38,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,"I will come to your household tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:43.60,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,So I prepared a small feast for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:47.86,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,While he was drinking, he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:52.76,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,"I heard you have a daughter named Diaochan."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:54.52,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,"You betrothed her to Fengxian."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:57.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(297.143,452.571)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2150,2600)}Lü Bù\NStyled: Fèngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:57.81,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,"I was afraid you were undecided,"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.78,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,"so I'm here to confirm this and meet her as well."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:04.64,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I could not dare let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:07.72,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,So I led Diaochan to greet the Grand Preceptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:10.26,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,He said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:13.55,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,"Today is a lucky day!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:18.24,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,"Allow me to take this girl to marry Fengxian."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:23.92,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Imagine this, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:29.17,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,The Grand Preceptor went to me to pick her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:32.36,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Dare I refuse him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:37.16,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I had to send my daughter over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:39.89,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,So that's how it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:45.97,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I had wronged you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:48.88,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I owe you my humblest apology!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:52.38,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General, you were not aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:54.06,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,What is there to apologize for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:20.29,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Where is the Grand Preceptor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:22.93,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,The Grand Preceptor is sleeping with his new bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.93,0:06:24.52,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,He hasn't gotten up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:27.45,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Who is the new bride?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.10,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,A girl named Diaochan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.01,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Diaochan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(498.286,442.286)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1980,2160)}Diāochán
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:19.00,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Come here, darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:28.20,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Fengxian, my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.70,0:07:30.57,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:37.66,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,No... Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:52.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(334.667,470.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2555,5555)}Dǒng Zhuō\NStyled: Zhòngyǐng
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:10.82,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:14.81,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You dare covet my mistress?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:17.76,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:19.76,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:21.65,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You are forbidden to enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:23.56,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Who is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:26.28,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,The Grand Preceptor sent this servant here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:30.64,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,He said; from now on, the Marquis of Wen can enter his mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:32.11,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,no need for formalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:42.98,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,That senile bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:45.70,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,He mocks me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:11:00.36,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,General, why aren't you in court with the Grand Preceptor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:16.58,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,We shouldn't talk here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:20.10,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,You may first go to Fengyi Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:22.08,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:31.50,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:38.16,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:53.23,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,General, though I am not \NExcellency Wang's natural-born daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:56.43,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,he treats me as if I were.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:13:00.43,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I've deeply loved you ever since we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:02.84,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Therefore, he betrothed me to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:07.22,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I hoped I could depend on you for all my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:13.54,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,but who'd expect the \NGrand Preceptor to be so lecherous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:15.94,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,He deflowered me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:22.07,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I didn't kill myself then, because I hadn't bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:23.98,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I had to endure the humiliation!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:25.90,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Yet by fortune, we're here together now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:35.75,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,My wish has been fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.53,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,My body has been defiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:40.49,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I cannot be with you any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:47.31,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I wish to die before you to express my resolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.65,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I knew that was how you were feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:14.27,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I only regret not being there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:19.58,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,If I can't be your wife in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:21.90,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,we'll have to meet in the next!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:49.32,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,If I cannot marry you in this life, then I am no hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:55.02,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,For me, a day here is like a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:14:58.74,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Every day, I force a smile before him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:15:00.96,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,then when I'm left alone, I weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:04.30,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Please take pity, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:08.55,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Save me as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:25.25,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Was Fengxian here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:26.52,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,He went to the inner hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:34.94,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Today, I came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:36.75,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the old lech will see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:37.86,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:42.38,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I have to leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.14,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:47.80,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,General, if you are so afraid of that old lech,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:52.41,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,then I'll never escape this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:59.18,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Give me time to think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:03.47,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Where's Diaochan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:05.54,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,In the garden admiring the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:13.06,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,When I was in my boudoir,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:18.02,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I heard of your fame like thunder piercing my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.53,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I thought you were the greatest hero of this era,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:23.81,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,but instead, even you are controlled by others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.17,0:16:57.38,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Grand Preceptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:34.06,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:38.06,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,I-I came here when I heard that you were furious,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:40.05,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,and pursued Lü Bu in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:41.18,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,When I was coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:42.62,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,I saw Lü Bu escaping, shouting,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:44.20,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,"The Grand Preceptor wants me dead!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:47.55,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,In my haste to mediate peace, I bumped into you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:49.93,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:52.22,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,That bastard whelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:54.14,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,He had the guts to corrupt my mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:55.29,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I'll kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:57.22,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Calm down! Grand Preceptor, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:59.64,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Grand Preceptor, do not do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:01.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(969.333,353.333)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2820,3120)}Lǐ Rú
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.86,0:18:15.14,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: King Zhuāng of Chǔ was one of the Five Hegemons of the Spring and Autumn period.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:11.27,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}One night in the past, King Zhuang\N of Chu hosted a feast for his officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:15.21,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When the candle went out,\N Jiang Xiong solicited the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:18.60,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but the queen ripped the tassel from his helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.97,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord8)}She asked the King to light \Nthe candle and find out who it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.97,0:18:25.42,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}but he ordered all the officials to remove their tassels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:27.62,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Afterwards, he lit the candle
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:29.39,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and made no further inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:37.76,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Later, King Zhuang of Chu was besieged by Qin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:41.80,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but Jiang Xiong risked his life and saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:46.43,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Today, Diaochan is just one mere woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:49.53,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lü Bu is your most trusted and fierce general.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:52.94,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Grand Preceptor, if you can seize this opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:55.18,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and give Diaochan to Lü Bu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:57.26,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lü Bu will be indebted to you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:59.40,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and will repay you with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:01.83,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That is what you can gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:08.69,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Grand Preceptor, please think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.33,0:19:20.10,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Harlot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:24.80,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You dare have an affair with Lü Bu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:26.62,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Grand Preceptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.49,0:19:33.05,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Grand Preceptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.47,0:19:41.78,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Grand Preceptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:45.37,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I was only admiring the flowers in the garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:47.52,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,when Lü Bu suddenly came!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:52.30,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I wanted to avoid him, but he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:55.62,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,"I am the Grand Preceptor's son. \NWhy must you avoid me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:20:00.31,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Afterwards, he forced me to go to Fengyi Pavilion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:07.17,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I knew he held ill will and that he'd assault me, disgracing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:19.05,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I was to drown myself in the lotus pond, \Nbut he held me from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:30.01,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I was between life and death when you came and saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.79,0:20:36.68,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,So that's how it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:42.25,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Thank you for your forgiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.45,0:21:20.82,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,What if I were to send you to Lü Bu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.40,0:21:25.09,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,How would it sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:43.37,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,I would rather die than be disgraced!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.85,0:21:55.86,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I was just joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:03.00,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,That sounds like Li Ru's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.41,0:22:05.36,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,He is deep friends with Lü Bu,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:11.68,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,so he made that plan despite your honor and my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:15.55,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,How could I bear to give you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:21.06,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Although you love me dearly,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:23.84,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,we cannot stay here for too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:26.68,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,or Lü Bu will certainly hurt us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.68,0:22:30.50,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,We'll live together in my manor of Meiwu tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:36.53,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You can enjoy a joyful life there,\N carefree and without worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.53,0:22:38.88,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Many thanks, Grand Preceptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.31,0:23:04.58,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Grand Preceptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.58,0:23:06.31,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Today is a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.23,0:23:09.77,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,You can send Diaochan to Fengxian now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.85,0:23:14.30,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,But Lü Bu and I are father and son!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.30,0:23:15.32,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,It'd be improper!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.67,0:23:17.78,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I'll ignore his faults, not even mind them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.78,0:23:21.25,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Go, you will soothe him with comforting words.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:24.34,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Grand Preceptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.91,0:23:27.60,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Do not be misled by that woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.82,0:23:35.78,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Would you give your beloved to Lü Bu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:41.50,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Do not talk about Diaochan ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.31,0:23:44.87,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Speak of this again and you will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.87,0:23:45.69,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Yes...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.07,0:24:28.12,Thinking,Li Ru,0,0,0,,We will all die at the hands of that woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.92,0:24:50.65,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.25,0:24:51.86,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.20,0:24:55.76,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,The other day, I stayed home because of a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.36,0:24:59.97,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,That is why we have not met for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.60,0:25:05.02,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Today, the Grand Preceptor rode to Meiwu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.02,0:25:06.90,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I saw him off despite my illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.33,0:25:12.56,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Why did you not follow him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.88,0:25:21.65,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,May I ask why you sighed, General?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.85,0:25:25.24,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Because of your daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.10,0:25:28.22,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,After all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.22,0:25:30.68,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,the Grand Preceptor still has my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.94,0:25:34.52,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,That lech keeps her for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.17,0:25:43.55,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I do not believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.19,0:25:49.68,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Where do I even start!?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.11,0:25:54.16,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Then we will discuss this in my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.39,0:26:27.57,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I never imagined he would be this barbaric!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.08,0:26:40.34,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,He has defiled my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.34,0:26:42.28,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,but also stole your wife, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.20,0:26:48.39,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,This will be ridiculed by the whole nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.31,0:26:54.10,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,They will ridicule not the Grand Preceptor, but you and I!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.85,0:27:05.82,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,It matters not if I am ridiculed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.82,0:27:08.04,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I was always senile and incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.64,0:27:11.28,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Yet you are a peerless hero of the realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.17,0:27:15.44,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,How can you bear such humiliation and disgrace?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.99,0:27:34.41,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I misspoke! Please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.79,0:27:38.77,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I will kill that decrepit wretch and avenge my disgrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.48,0:27:41.87,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General, do not get me into trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.76,0:27:47.44,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,A real man should stand up\N between Heaven and Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.93,0:27:50.48,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,How could I submit to him any longer!?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.07,0:27:59.84,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,With your talents, how could the Grand Preceptor restrain you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.19,0:28:01.84,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I will butcher that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.35,0:28:03.21,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.22,0:28:09.45,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,How can I if we are as father and son?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.31,0:28:14.33,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I fear being judged by posterity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.70,0:28:19.80,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Your surname is Lü,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.77,0:28:23.64,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,but his surname is Dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:26.39,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General, think back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.96,0:28:30.28,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,He threw your halberd at you at Fengyi Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.43,0:28:34.61,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Were you father and son then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.11,0:28:44.58,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Without your words, I would be lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.20,0:28:47.50,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General, if you revive the Han dynasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.16,0:28:50.06,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,you'll be known as its loyal officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.94,0:28:54.35,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Your name in history will become one of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.75,0:29:01.02,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General, if you aid Dong Zhuo, you will be known as a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.26,0:29:04.97,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Your name in history will become one of infamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.85,0:29:13.91,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Advantages and disadvantages.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.26,0:29:16.42,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,To be pure or impure, to be loyal or disloyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.05,0:29:18.42,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.13,0:29:21.21,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,please consider this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.16,0:29:48.58,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Your words let me see the sun through the clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.75,0:29:50.08,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Everything is clear now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.22,0:29:54.76,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I am committed, do not doubt that!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.94,0:29:57.89,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Only that...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.04,0:29:59.94,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Only that...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.81,0:30:05.14,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Only that if our plan fails, we will be doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.81,0:30:10.64,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I swear to revive the State of Han by killing the traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.64,0:30:14.04,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If I betray my word, \Nthen doom me for all of eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.40,0:30:16.13,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.01,0:30:30.21,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If the House of Han does not fall, it is to your credit, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.55,0:30:32.80,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Please accept my respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.16,0:30:36.85,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.43,0:30:47.59,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Does Your Excellency have a plan to slay the traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.59,0:30:49.36,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When the time comes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.46,0:30:52.14,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I will tell you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.29,0:31:07.89,Thinking,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo is far away at Meiwu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.37,0:31:13.78,Thinking,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I could send an eloquent man to Meiwu,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.78,0:31:16.19,Thinking,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,asking him to attend court to discuss matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.82,0:31:22.15,Thinking,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,But who to send there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.18,0:31:27.15,Thinking,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Li Su was a supporter of Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.95,0:31:33.34,Thinking,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,He persuaded Lü Bu to kill Ding Yuan, but Dong Zhuo did not promote him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.57,0:31:35.21,Thinking,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,He harbors a grudge due to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.35,0:31:40.84,Thinking,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,If I send Li Su, that traitor will not be suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.90,0:31:47.72,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.08,0:31:50.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(308,422.667)}Lǐ Sù
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.92,0:31:49.97,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Your Excellency!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.67,0:31:52.38,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.60,0:31:55.06,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.36,0:31:56.01,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.59,0:32:12.29,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Brother Li Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.68,0:32:18.18,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,you got me to kill Ding Jianyang and join Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.16,0:32:22.49,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Now that lech abuses the Emperor \Nand oppresses the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.49,0:32:25.55,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,With his innumerable sins, \Nhe is hated by both men and divinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.55,0:32:31.56,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Now His Excellency asks you to announce an edict at Meiwu manor for Dong Zhuo to enter court.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.68,0:32:38.14,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I will have soldiers hidden around court to slay this traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.41,0:32:41.13,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,We will aid the Han dynasty as loyal ministers!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.84,0:32:45.81,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,What is your honorable opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.62,0:32:50.30,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Excellency!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.78,0:32:52.00,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Thank you, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.48,0:32:57.83,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I wished to kill that traitor for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.83,0:32:59.34,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I was without allies,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.34,0:33:02.27,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,but now I have your heaven-sent plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.90,0:33:10.66,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I will not betray you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.91,0:33:15.56,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,General, please go to Meiwu.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.67,0:33:38.47,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My beloved, I had a dream of\N a dragon covering my body last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.47,0:33:41.47,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sure enough, good news came today!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.47,0:33:47.00,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Son of Heaven summoned me into the court {\bord12}to abdicate the throne to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.35,0:33:55.25,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Excellency Wang built an abdication platform for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.25,0:33:59.06,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}They're just waiting for me to accept the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.27,0:34:04.98,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}After I become the Son of Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.98,0:34:08.10,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}you will become my most noble concubine!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.49,0:34:15.68,Default,Diaochan,0,0,0,,Thank you for your great favor, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.01,0:34:26.86,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Beautiful girl, just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.87,0:34:33.49,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I'll take you to the palace real soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.15,0:34:58.58,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A wheel broke and a horse escaped its reins.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.58,0:34:59.96,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What do these omens foretell?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.96,0:35:03.41,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord, you will ascend the throne, beginning a new era!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.41,0:35:06.56,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}They bode you riding a jade carriage on a golden seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:09.58,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,The heavens are on my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.24,0:35:31.43,Default,Children,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What vast grass, how green it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.43,0:35:34.01,Default,Children,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Come ten days, it all dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.37,0:35:38.04,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Does that song bode good or ill fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.96,0:35:42.96,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,It bodes the Liu clan dying and Dong clan thriving!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.56,0:35:46.95,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,Stop singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.95,0:35:49.05,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,Go play over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.05,0:35:50.72,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,What's wrong with a little song?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.56,0:35:58.90,Note (Potential style?),Peasant,0,0,0,,"Vast grass" = 千里草 > 董 "Dong"\N "Come ten days" = 十日卜 > 卓 "Zhuo"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.75,0:35:52.55,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,Do you know what it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.55,0:35:55.98,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"The" "vast" "grass" means "Dong"; \N"Come" "ten" "days" means "Zhuo."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.98,0:35:57.92,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}It means that Dong Zhuo won't live any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.92,0:35:58.91,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You want to die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.40,0:36:51.14,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,August Heaven, bless us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.38,0:36:54.27,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,August Heaven, bless us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.88,0:36:56.16,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,August Heaven, bless us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.44,0:37:41.73,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,My respects, imperial father!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.76,0:37:44.82,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,It's alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.71,0:37:48.86,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Congratulations, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.61,0:37:52.24,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,After I accept the Emperor's abdication,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.24,0:37:56.29,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,you will command all the armies in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.73,0:38:01.38,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Thank you, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.76,0:38:08.45,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Why aren't Wang Yun and Li Ru here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.51,0:38:14.68,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Wang Yun awaits you on the abdication platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.68,0:38:18.21,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Li Ru caught an illness, so he could not come.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.77,0:38:22.16,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I respectfully invite you to ascend the platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.18,0:38:25.60,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.27,0:38:34.94,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.75,0:39:30.08,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,The traitor scum has arrived! \NSummon the warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.50,0:39:36.68,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Fengxian, where are you, my son?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.26,0:39:38.48,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Here is the edict!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.48,0:39:42.00,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Kill the evil Dong Zhuo! The rest will be pardoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:44.85,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Fengxian, my son! Why are you doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.66,0:39:48.32,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Old bastard! We cannot coexist!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.78,0:40:01.96,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.25,0:40:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dong the Villain"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.55,0:41:02.35,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.08,0:41:03.73,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.10,0:42:07.45,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Why speak of Meiwu in spring, \Nignorant of heavens and people?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.45,0:42:15.59,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The abdication platform\N became the gallows;
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.32,0:42:29.60,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}can one find the \Nimperial dream there?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.27,0:42:38.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Away from riches \Nand prestige and people
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.28,0:42:48.35,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}bid farewell to the \Nstruggle between beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.12,0:42:57.99,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}forsake the delicate years of youth,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.99,0:43:06.51,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and lose blooming maidenhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.94,0:43:15.60,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To repay the Minister's great kindness and profound love,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.60,0:43:23.81,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}gave up did I, this body as delicate as a flower and refined as jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.16,0:43:32.41,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}From now, never will \Nyou see a shade of mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.41,0:43:40.93,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}never hear the voice of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.44,0:43:49.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Diāochán has drifted away with the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.68,0:43:57.60,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}become as like the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.84,0:44:06.01,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Diāochán has drifted away with the wind,
